@startuml
title Flames of War V4 Calculator — system context
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor User
rectangle "Flames of War Combat Calculator" {
  component "Streamlit application\n(app.py + view.py)\nIMPLEMENTED: legacy UI" as App
  component "Legacy abstract simulation\n(model.py + controller.py)\nIMPLEMENTED" as Legacy
  component "V1.0.0 shooting situation\ndomain input types\nIMPLEMENTED: data contracts only" as Domain
  component "V4 probability resolution\nPLANNED / UNRESOLVED" as V4
}
cloud "Python runtime" as Python
database "NumPy\nrandom sampling + arrays" as NumPy

User --> App : enters legacy controls / views results
App --> Legacy : CombatInput; calculate
Legacy --> App : CombatResult
App --> Domain : no current call path
Domain ..> V4 : intended input foundation
V4 ..> App : future result integration
Legacy --> NumPy : simulation draws
App --> NumPy : histogram/statistics
Legacy ..> Python
App ..> Python

note bottom of V4
No implemented V4 calculator consumes ShootingSituation.
No weapon/unit database or identity service exists or is required.
end note
@enduml
